 "titulo": "The dam that didn't break, and still wiped out a town 🇮🇹 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "THE DAM SURVIVED",
 "descripcion": "In 1963 the Vajont Dam in Italy held perfectly. The mountain beside the lake didn't. A landslide hit the reservoir and threw a wave over the top of the dam.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#howitworks #engineering #science #shorts",
 "tags": [
